# Experiment run logs are written here at training time.
# Each run gets its own subdirectory: configs/experiment_runs/<timestamp>/
#   fold_01.json  …  fold_N.json   — per-fold metrics
#   summary.json                   — aggregate metrics + config
#   coverage_report.json           — ticker coverage gaps (if --coverage enabled)
#
# These files are intentionally excluded from git (see .gitignore).
